  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14262782/assets/9283bcc77ac8e63c1ba00f9a81e659bcbcf41bc98b94a1a0617b02feab71cf0a.png)\n\nCar $B$ is being driven due south toward Caltech at a speed of $60\\,\\text{km/h},$ while car $A$ is being driven due east away from Caltech. When car $B$ is $0.6\\,\\text{km}$ away from Caltech, car $A$ is $0.8\\,\\text{km}$ from Caltech. If the distance between the two vehicles is increasing at a rate of $20\\,\\text{km/h},$ what is the speed of car $A?$",
